{1}{Why hello, good sir!  Haven't seen you around here before--that means you MUST be here for the race and the 50,000 gold jackpot!  }{Why hello, good madame!  Haven't seen you around here before--that means you MUST be here for the race and the 50,000 gold jackpot!}{}{}{}{qu 1000 1}
