{5}{[He chuckles.] Oh, there's really nothing much to it. First one to leave the castle and report back to me with a Mystic Sapphire gets the loot!  The less time it takes you to clear the dungeon, the more of the jackpot you'll get.  But, keep in mind, you also accumulate gold for each monster you slay--get my meaning?}{[He chuckles.] Oh, there's really nothing much to it. First one to leave the castle and report back to me with a Mystic Sapphire gets the loot!  The less time it takes you to clear the dungeon, the more of the jackpot you'll get.  But, keep in mind, you also accumulate gold for each monster you slay--get my meaning?}{}{}{}{}
{6}{Sounds simple.  What should I expect to find in this castle?}{}{5}{}{10}{}
